{\pard\sb200\sa80 \b\fs26\cf2 Song: Sunrise City\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Artist:} Neon Echo\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Genre:} pop | {\b Mood:} happy\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Energy:} 0.82 (very high) | {\b Tempo:} 118 BPM (moderate) | {\b Valence:} 0.84 (very high) | {\b Danceability:} 0.79 (high) | {\b Acousticness:} 0.18 (very low)\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Description:} A bright, sun-soaked pop anthem built on glossy synths, a bouncing bassline and a big sing-along chorus about leaving the city at dawn. It feels like windows-down optimism.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Sound:} glossy synth pads, bright synth lead, bouncing electric bass, punchy programmed drums, handclaps, layered backing vocals\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Vocals:} lead female vocal with a big multi-tracked sing-along chorus\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Structure:} short synth intro, two verses, a pre-chorus that builds, a soaring chorus, a stripped-down bridge with just bass and vocals, and a final double chorus with extra harmonies\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Lyric themes:} Leaving the city at dawn with friends, the skyline turning gold, and the feeling that the whole day is still ahead.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Listen when:} road trips, getting ready to go out, sunny mornings, any time you want an instant mood lift\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Skip when:} you need to concentrate or wind down; the chorus is designed to grab attention\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Good for:} party, road trip\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Similar songs:} Starlight Sprint (k-pop), Rooftop Lights (indie pop), Laser Bloom (edm)\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Comparisons:} Compared with Sunrise City, Starlight Sprint is more energetic (0.88 vs 0.82), k-pop instead of pop. Compared with Sunrise City, Rooftop Lights is less energetic (0.76 vs 0.82), more acoustic, indie pop instead of pop.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Listening tip:} The bridge drops almost everything out, so the final chorus hits harder on good speakers or in a car.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Questions and answers:}\par}
