{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Q: Is Sunrise City good for party? A: Yes; its happy mood and very high energy (0.82) fit the party target of euphoric mood and energy around 0.88.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Q: Is Sunrise City good for sleep? A: Not really; its happy mood and very high energy (0.82) do not fit the sleep target of chill mood and energy around 0.2.\par}
