{\pard\sb240\sa80 \b\fs32\cf1 Chapter 4: Genre guide\par}
{\pard\sb160\sa80 \b\fs22\cf1 Genre: pop\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Catchy, hook-driven songs with polished production. Pop fans usually enjoy indie pop and k-pop, which share the same bright melodies and verse-chorus structure.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} pop music, top 40, mainstream | {\b Related genres:} indie pop, k-pop, edm\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Sunrise City, Gym Hero\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Songs in related genres:} Rooftop Lights (indie pop), Laser Bloom (edm), Starlight Sprint (k-pop)\par}
{\pard\sb160\sa80 \b\fs22\cf1 Genre: indie pop\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Pop melodies with a looser, more handmade sound. Often warmer and a bit more acoustic than mainstream pop.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} indie, bedroom pop | {\b Related genres:} pop, folk, synthwave\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Rooftop Lights\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Songs in related genres:} Sunrise City (pop), Gym Hero (pop), Night Drive Loop (synthwave), Paper Boats (folk)\par}
{\pard\sb160\sa80 \b\fs22\cf1 Genre: k-pop\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Korean pop: high-energy, heavily produced, dance-focused, with sharp choreography-ready beats.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} kpop, korean pop | {\b Related genres:} pop, edm, hip-hop\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Starlight Sprint\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Songs in related genres:} Sunrise City (pop), Gym Hero (pop), Concrete Crown (hip-hop), Laser Bloom (edm)\par}
{\pard\sb160\sa80 \b\fs22\cf1 Genre: lofi\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Mellow, dusty beats with soft piano and vinyl crackle. A classic choice for studying and focus because it has steady rhythm and no distracting vocals.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} lo-fi, lo fi, lofi hip hop, study beats | {\b Related genres:} ambient, jazz, hip-hop\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Midnight Coding, Library Rain, Focus Flow\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Songs in related genres:} Spacewalk Thoughts (ambient), Coffee Shop Stories (jazz), Concrete Crown (hip-hop)\par}
{\pard\sb160\sa80 \b\fs22\cf1 Genre: ambient\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Slow, textural music without a strong beat. Very low energy; good for sleep, meditation, and deep focus.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} atmospheric, drone, soundscape | {\b Related genres:} lofi, classical\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Spacewalk Thoughts\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Songs in related genres:} Midnight Coding (lofi), Library Rain (lofi), Focus Flow (lofi), Moonlit Sonata Redux (classical)\par}
