{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 Improvised, swinging music. Low-to-medium energy jazz works well in the background for cooking, dinner, and coffee shops.\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Also called:} smooth jazz, coffee shop jazz | {\b Related genres:} lofi, blues, r&b\par}
{\pard\sb0\sa80 \fs18 {\b Catalog songs:} Coffee Shop Stories\par}
